  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 97 01}副队长大人\n还在麻痹中。\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0006/battle/support/bsv121.bvp_(059).BMD.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 A1 01}花村阳介先生！竟麻痹得不能动……\n真是令人失望！\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0006/battle/support/bsv121.bvp_(059).BMD.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 A2 01}里中千枝小姐摇摇晃晃的。\n啊！？那就是传说中的“醉拳”！\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0006/battle/support/bsv121.bvp_(059).BMD.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 A3 01}天城雪子小姐的麻痹还没解除。\n仿佛跪坐太久了一样……\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0006/battle/support/bsv121.bvp_(059).BMD.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 A4 01}巽完二先生的麻痹还没解除……\n巽完二先生！靠毅力想想办法！\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0006/battle/support/bsv121.bvp_(059).BMD.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 A6 01}白钟直斗小姐还在麻痹中。\n也许无法行动呢。\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0006/battle/support/bsv121.bvp_(059).BMD.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 A5 01}小熊大人还在麻痹中呢。\n这下……也许指望不上了。\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0006/battle/support/bsv121.bvp_(059).BMD.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 98 01}岳羽由加莉小姐的麻痹还没解除。\n但愿还能行动……\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0006/battle/support/bsv121.bvp_(059).BMD.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 99 01}伊织顺平先生仍在麻痹中。\n这恐怕无法行动吧……\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0006/battle/support/bsv121.bvp_(059).BMD.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 9A 01}真田明彦先生的麻痹还没解除。\n……偏偏在这种关键时刻……\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0006/battle/support/bsv121.bvp_(059).BMD.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 9B 01}桐条美鹤小姐仍在麻痹中……\n在下担心她能否行动。\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0006/battle/support/bsv121.bvp_(059).BMD.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H121_060_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 9E 01}埃癸斯小姐的麻痹仍在持续。\n……原来她也会麻痹呢……\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
